An empty value clears a field. A cleared list or flow is left out of the body, which clears it in Garmin. A note that is left out keeps its value, so a cleared note is sent as "". --no-ovulation removes the ovulation mark.
-- args --
wellness
menstrual-log
set
2026-10-01
--flow

--symptoms

--notes

--no-ovulation
